 Builds on macOS only:
 
 ```bash
-./build.sh macos
-# -> dist/Portal-macos-arm64.dmg (create-dmg is installed on first use)
+APPLE_DEVELOPER_ID="Developer ID Application: Name (TEAMID)" ./build.sh macos
